  "以參考圖約束人物或場景，生成時間連續的影片。": "Use reference images to constrain characters or scenes and generate temporally continuous video.",
  "分離主體與背景條件，重新生成並協調主體光照，改善合成圖的受光與邊緣銜接。": "Separate subject and background conditions, then regenerate and harmonize subject lighting to improve illumination and compositing edges.",
