  "以遮罩選定修改範圍，進行物件修補、移除或局部內容替換。": "Use a mask to select an area for repair, object removal, or local content replacement.",
  "將即時畫面帶入影像生成或重繪，觀察輸入變化對結果的影響。": "Feed live images into generation or repainting to observe how input changes affect results.",
  "將圖像與形狀資料整理為網格、材質或角色圖層，供三維角色處理使用。": "Organize images and geometry into meshes, materials, or character layers for 3D character processing.",
  "將輸入圖片像素化，整理色塊與輪廓，製作像素風格素材。": "Pixelate an input image and organize colors and outlines into pixel-style assets.",
  "分割主體或服裝區域，產生去背圖片、圖層或可供後續處理的遮罩。": "Segment subjects or clothing to produce background-removed images, layers, or masks for later processing.",
